# Markdown is owned by markdownlint, not Prettier — a deliberate narrowing of
# REPO_SKELETON.md §6.1's "Prettier formats TS/JSON/MD/YAML".
#
# The docs are the primary artefact of this repo right now, hand-wrapped at ~95 columns with
# tables sized for reading in a terminal. Prettier pads every table cell to the widest row,
# which turns a readable table into a 700-column line, and it rewrites `*emphasis*` to
# `_emphasis_` for no gain. Reflowing prose someone else wrote also produces enormous diffs
# that collide with agents working in the same file.
#
# One tool still owns markdown, so §6.1's actual point — nobody has to work out which
# formatter owns a file — holds.
*.md
